# Machine-local overrides are never tracked — they live in $HOME, not here,
# but guard against a stray copy landing in the repo.
*.local
*.local.ps1
profile.local.ps1

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# Nothing generated is tracked. Rendered PDF/HTML/PNG output lives in archive/
# and stays local — docs/cheatsheet.md supersedes it. Note that untracking does
# not remove the four blobs already in history; a clone still downloads them.
archive/

# Working notes for the next session: local scratch, not part of the published
# repo. Keep it, do not publish it.
HANDOFF.md

# The PowerShell port audit: working notes, not published material.
# Distilled conclusions live in docs/powershell.md.
prd-powershell.md
